<title>USA: Food Lion asks jurors to send a message.</title>
<headline>Food Lion asks jurors to send a message.</headline>
<dateline>GREENSBORO, N.C. 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Closing arguments began Monday in the last phase of Food Lion's lawsuit against Walt Disney Co's unit, ABC, with a Food Lion attorney urging jurors to send a message condemning deceptive and potentially dangerous journalism.</p>
<p>The jury late last year ruled that ABC and four of its news producers committed fraud, trespass and breach of loyalty in undercover reporting for a hidden-camera story on the supermarket chain's food-handling practices.</p>
</text>
